+       test program::tests::a_parent_s_bin_folder_up_to_the_root_comes_before_path ... ok
+  2. yamt_app lib: test result: ok. 53 passed; 0 failed
+     yamt_lsp_host lib: test result: ok. 19 passed; 0 failed
